{"seq":3,"slug":"enduring-icon","title":"永恒的偶像","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/influence-and-legacy/enduring-icon","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-universal-genius","title":"全能的天才","url":"/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/influence-and-legacy/enduring-icon/a-universal-genius","wordCount":1451,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"cultural-immortality","title":"文化的不朽","url":"/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/influence-and-legacy/enduring-icon/cultural-immortality","wordCount":1563,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 永恒的偶像\n\n达·芬奇是人类智慧与创造力的永恒象征。本章揭示这份不朽的遗产。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"全能的天才\"——他作为全能天才终极象征的跨时代魅力。第二篇文档讲述\"文化的不朽\",呈现他如何深嵌全球文化、获得永恒的不朽。\n"}